  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUpporting STronger Access to Energy INitiatives in Displacement  settings (SUSTAINED)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of SUSTAINED is to increase use of quality, reliable, affordable, and clean energy sources - for electricity, cooking, and income-generating opportunities, including water pumping &#x2013; refugees and their host communities (70:30 split) over the next five years, at least 50% of them will be women. The intervention will take place in Uganda, in Bidibidi, Mvempi and Rhino, Kyangwali, Kyaka II and Nakivale settlements.</narrative>
  </description>
